<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0d10" /><meta name="description" content="About Valen — software engineer, architect, and builder interested in reducing friction and improving the way systems are built." /><title>About · Valen</title></head>
<body><main><header><a href={base}>Valen</a><nav><a href={`${base}archive/`}>Archive</a><a class="active" href={`${base}about/`}>About</a></nav></header>
<article><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Software, systems, and the space between them.</h1><p><strong>Valentín Liñeiro — Software engineer, 10+ years building backend systems, architectures and developer tooling.</strong></p><p>I work at the intersection of architecture, developer experience and AI-assisted engineering. My focus is reducing friction, preserving good decisions, and building systems that remain changeable.</p><p><strong>Currently:</strong> Java · TypeScript · distributed systems · AI-assisted workflows<br/><strong>Interested in:</strong> architecture · DX · agentic workflows</p><p><strong>Selected work:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/valentinlineiro/takt">TAKT</a> · <a href="https://github.com/valentinlineiro/blog">this blog</a></p><div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/valentinlineiro">GitHub</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/valentinlineiro/">LinkedIn</a><a href={`${base}rss.xml`}>RSS</a></div></article>
<footer><a href={base}>← Home</a></footer></main></body></html>
<style>:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(html),:global(body){background:#0b0d10}:global(body){margin:0;color:#e8e3da;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;line-height:1.8}:global(:focus-visible){outline:2px solid #d7a66a;outline-offset:4px}main{max-width:900px;min-height:100vh;margin:auto;padding:0 48px}header{height:92px;border-bottom:1px solid #1d2025;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}header>a{font:1.55rem Georgia,serif;text-decoration:none}nav{display:flex;gap:34px}nav a{color:#9aa0a8;text-decoration:none}nav a.active,nav a:hover{color:#e8e3da}.active:after{content:"";display:block;height:2px;margin-top:8px;background:#d7a66a}article{max-width:700px;padding:110px 0}article .eyebrow{color:#d7a66a;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:.82rem}h1{font:400 clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem)/1.05 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:18px 0 42px}article p:not(.eyebrow){color:#c2c6cc;font-size:1.18rem;max-width:620px;margin:0 0 24px}.links{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:42px}.links a{color:#d7a66a;text-decoration:none}.links a:hover{color:#e8e3da}footer{padding:34px 0;color:#9aa0a8}footer a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:640px){main{padding:0 24px}header{height:78px}nav{gap:20px}article{padding:76px 0}}
